
pipe (f290 )
  comment : '/' followed by '*' is the start of a comment. Change delimiter from '/' to '!' |
  literal First~record Second~line~follows Odd~record | split | xlate /~/ / |
  specs
    word 1   1.4
    word 2  11.4
    word 3  21.4
    read
    !*****! 26
    word 1   6.4
    word 2  16.4
    word 3  26 |
  console

